     7	 *   string (a button's second line, an aria-label). It returns null when the amount
     8	 *   is missing, never "Rs 0".
     9	 * - A missing amount renders nothing. The screen decides what to say instead.
    10	 * - The colour is inherited from the parent.
    11	 * - No rounding here: the salary-advance module guarantees whole rupees.
    12	 */
